pixiv.net/artworks/116258673", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Livetarica/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7fad645d/uploads/origins/9e234800-8c82-43ea-8d55-9f15acc2f8d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=776387bd438bb9152355736eff968f37", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7fad645d/uploads/origins/9e234800-8c82-43ea-8d55-9f15acc2f8d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=776387bd438bb9152355736eff968f37, https://si.imgix.net/7fad645d/uploads/origins/9e234800-8c82-43ea-8d55-9f15acc2f8d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6ce44c9b7fd47767122fa77cd98345b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7fad645d/uploads/origins/9e234800-8c82-43ea-8d55-9f15acc2f8d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d6658818b66eb18f67b5bad8f7a4529 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "イラストをお願いします\n\nキャラはブルアカの歌住サクラコ、コスチュームは覚悟でお馴染みの礼装、ポーズや構図はお任せでお願いします\nこちらもTwitter、Discordのアイコンにするので、いい感じに合うようにして頂けると助かります\n\n尚、胸は好きに盛ったり、難しければそのままでもお好きになさって下さい\n\n難しい依頼かもしれませんが、ご一考頂けると幸いです", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Livetarica/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/130f8433/uploads/origins/9555dfa9-e4ba-4bd8-89a2-903ef800eec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea2b8ba4dbc02578a4e936712bfba05b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/130f8433/uploads/origins/9555dfa9-e4ba-4bd8-89a2-903ef800eec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea2b8ba4dbc02578a4e936712bfba05b, https://si.imgix.net/130f8433/uploads/origins/9555dfa9-e4ba-4bd8-89a2-903ef800eec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d82c79b8906011b079fc01b6424838e6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/130f8433/uploads/origins/9555dfa9-e4ba-4bd8-89a2-903ef800eec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=